        "description": "Identification of pathogenic variants in the OXCT1 gene",
        "category": "major",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": true
      },
      {
        "id": "urine-organic-acids",
        "description": "Presence of elevated ketone bodies and organic acids in urine organic acid analysis",
